  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve higher accuracy (0.6529) than singleprofile or pca_n2000-based models. This experiment tests whether using pca_n2000 RNA encoder with transformer aggregation (config_003) can match or exceed scvi_n200's performance, clarifying the relative importance of RNA encoder choice vs. aggregation method. It isolates the effect of RNA representation while leveraging the promising transformer aggregation from config_006, balancing exploration of key design choices with exploitation of prior results."  
